{"steam_appid":3308870,"steam_name":"and Roger","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3308870/1250831174/1e30e1260ce8548fdc9ed95e2b96d419c944240e/1774426310/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1774426544","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257296581/61fb05f770bea5b8f3f96e007ecabd85e611ecd1/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1774426544","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308870/50080e49e2034d3822e6ec5ee6430cc83fda1917/ss_50080e49e2034d3822e6ec5ee6430cc83fda1917.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785139006","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308870/57fd24cf115056e78f37a12c28cb91b5cc896925/ss_57fd24cf115056e78f37a12c28cb91b5cc896925.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785139006","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308870/5ee84caa7ade95276eb81cdd53eb30dfdbe41951/ss_5ee84caa7ade95276eb81cdd53eb30dfdbe41951.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785139006","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308870/ec9ec7e9faab4b7da602f9caf24f06a265f38f54/ss_ec9ec7e9faab4b7da602f9caf24f06a265f38f54.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785139006","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308870/bea2899d5c201a46646d8b955747cfe273725280/ss_bea2899d5c201a46646d8b955747cfe273725280.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785139006"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308870/extras/acff1cc1235ef2313b9f867cb4cd2523.avif?t=1785139006\" width=1560 height=216 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>and Roger</i></strong> is an interactive novel that lets you see through the protagonist's eyes—whether what she sees makes sense or not. It is comprised of three chapters and can be played in its entirety in about one hour.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's just another morning for this young girl. She wakes up and starts getting herself ready while shaking off the sleepiness like always. Except something, somehow, feels off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308870/extras/e8429be6075dd7c36428280ea6865b20.poster.avif?t=1785139006\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308870/extras/e8429be6075dd7c36428280ea6865b20.webm?t=1785139006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308870/extras/e8429be6075dd7c36428280ea6865b20.mp4?t=1785139006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When she steps into the living room, she expects to find her dad preparing for work. Instead, she finds a stranger sleeping on the couch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308870/extras/d5410d60affaf58feed2df83880d07d4.poster.avif?t=1785139006\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308870/extras/d5410d60affaf58feed2df83880d07d4.webm?t=1785139006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308870/extras/d5410d60affaf58feed2df83880d07d4.mp4?t=1785139006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The man wakes up, looks at the girl, and sighs. Ignoring her confusion, he mumbles to himself with a hint of sadness in his voice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308870/extras/eb8b50b382d21659193e727a779f9f28.poster.avif?t=1785139006\" width=1170 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308870/extras/eb8b50b382d21659193e727a779f9f28.webm?t=1785139006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308870/extras/eb8b50b382d21659193e727a779f9f28.mp4?t=1785139006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308870/extras/07e85fb667109cbd10b46045926fba15.poster.avif?t=1785139006\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308870/extras/07e85fb667109cbd10b46045926fba15.webm?t=1785139006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308870/extras/07e85fb667109cbd10b46045926fba15.mp4?t=1785139006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scared, the girl runs. She must leave the house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308870/extras/1b78e5cb896fe01f771b2196a327eba0.avif?t=1785139006\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308870/extras_big/1b78e5cb896fe01f771b2196a327eba0.avif?t=1785139006 width=800 height=660 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308870/extras/789829924e06fcb4b55f02960fc56441.avif?t=1785139006\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308870/extras_big/789829924e06fcb4b55f02960fc56441.avif?t=1785139006 width=800 height=798 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She doesn't know who this man is or where her father has gone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk alongside her on this twisting, twisted path and see where it will lead her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308870/extras/b70cec4eefb2882256c25476b01b8ce2.poster.avif?t=1785139006\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308870/extras/b70cec4eefb2882256c25476b01b8ce2.webm?t=1785139006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-6100 | AMD FX-8350<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA Geforce GTX 750 Ti | AMD Radeon R7 360<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"","genres":["Adventure","Casual","Indie","Simulation"],"developers":["TearyHand Studio"],"publishers":["Kodansha"],"release_date":"23 Jul, 2025"}